## Part 4: How Zero-Signal Nanobots Handle Physical Pursuance

This is the desert scenario. Pursuers with multispectral scanners, hunter-killer drones, and time.

**The Defensive Strategy: Become Geology**

| Physical Pursuit Vector | How Zero-Signal Handles It |
